/*
 *
 * Description
 *	Read an OFF object data file.
 *
 * Output
 *
 * Input
 *	Obj		Pointer to object structure in which to store data.
 *	FileName	Name of file to be read.
 *
 * Diagnostics
 *	Returns 0 if successful, -1 if unsuccessful for any reason.
 *
